    "text": "<p>Match List - I with List - II:</p><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"width: 500px;\">\t<tbody>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">List-I (Property)</td>\t\t\t<td colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">List-II (Example)</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>(a)</td>\t\t\t<td>Diamagnetism</td>\t\t\t<td>(i)</td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>MnO</mi></math></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>(b)</td>\t\t\t<td>Ferrimagnetism</td>\t\t\t<td>(ii)</td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>(c)</td>\t\t\t<td>Paramagnetism</td>\t\t\t<td>(iii)</td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>NaCl</mi></math></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>(d)</td>\t\t\t<td>Antiferromagnetism</td>\t\t\t<td>(iv)</td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>Fe</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>4</mn></msub></math></td>\t\t</tr>\t</tbody></table><p>Choose the most appropriate answer from the options given below:</p>",
